  lines:
  - speakerName: Humberto
    text: Kay! Here's the deal.
  - speakerName: Humberto
    text: You're gonna get those mushrooms for me.
  - speakerName: Humberto
    text: And this time we are gonna do things differently.
  - speakerName: Humberto
    text: And this time we are gonna do things differently.
  - speakerName: Humberto
    text: I can't keep dying like this, son.
  - speakerName: Humberto
    text: I'm REALLY tired of being a fucking pig.
  - speakerName: Humberto
    text: I need vengeance, I need my family, I need to stop being a PIG.
  - speakerName: Humberto
    text: We'll talk later.
